{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:625f71a471265f2ff5f5ba2e633bee424cd8fa5b48969a24338a5467c197c2d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23b7138aefa2043760efd3da41a7d329d9da8d0ce1e9bc8b382cea786290856c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？是我！\n我是秋月——看屏幕显示就知道了对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1058ff891006f4a0be76be5fea3868760c3175da8a8594f847126dcf024780",
      "text": "我想跟您聊聊我单独出演的那场演出，\n所以打通了电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a25d48f305d4d695e82485ef4fe064b43b4a97c37933d5888a279e1dadb39df9",
      "text": "因为这次的会场是室外，\n感觉声音能传到很远很远的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:153baf5f63b2df5b1105d546a50e5d1c97f87f7cfb41ce131b5a15499869b5c6",
      "text": "对了对了，演出中还放飞了气球，\n真是一场极具户外特色的演出呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf5045c10c1fb58a52112a5ba0c0e0399d74a7e376cd0badbfa03a4b51bd02c5",
      "text": "能和粉丝们一起看到那么棒的景色，\n我真的特别开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1de94bc07c2b41f21bfbe7fb3f012a8a208b3f7f63ac6e5d37e165bf30fd36a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f85c8d65d963fb1631387aab2cf8a7b0283ca429c5aa7b5dc6b66259c642dc10",
      "text": "如果只靠我一个人的力量，我想是绝对\n无法出演那场演出的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9388b4a96df59c1ffa149aeba9d7a382ee1369f135cb057b2cd17f32613ef8b6",
      "text": "这是凉先生自己的实力哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cec0c3d776c8c102dadbe72a1ca2c85e6efb65d64b4a25de3eba396f9b4fd7c",
      "text": "是、是这样吗？诶嘿嘿，谢谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_a:2_4_041_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46424369ee334bf3cf6a2b0b4c986a01659288021f2de501d7fcac5522d9bfee",
      "text": "为了不辜负制作人的期待，\n我今后也会以帅气的偶像为目标继续努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
